OL,3,AIran says it will wait for official US
OL,4,Aresponse after Trump rejects Strait of
OL,5,AHormuz proposal
OL,6,
OL,7,FIran has said it will wait for an
OL,8,Fofficial response from US negotiators
OL,9,Fafter President Donald Trump rejected a
OL,10,Fproposal to reopen the Strait of Hormuz
OL,11,Fto commercial shipping within seven
OL,12,Fdays.
OL,14,FIn a post on Telegram, Iranian Foreign
OL,15,FMinister Abbas Araghchi acknowledged
OL,16,FTrump's rejection, but accused the
OL,17,Fpresident of previously making
OL,18,Fcontradictory statements.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
