OL,3,AIran says it will wait for official US
OL,4,Aresponse after Trump rejects Strait of
OL,5,AHormuz proposal
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier, Trump told reporters at the
OL,8,FWhite House that Tehran's proposal was
OL,9,Fnot "acceptable" and that they wanted
OL,10,Fto make a deal to open the strait
OL,11,Fimmediately because "they're losing so
OL,12,Fbadly".
OL,14,FOn Friday at the UN, Araghchi told
OL,15,Freporters that an agreement could be
OL,16,Freached if "necessary conditions are
OL,17,Fmet" between the two countries.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
